     "<div dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Hello Forum Members,</b></p><p><b><br></b></p><p>As we reach our first anniversary at Microsoft, we’re happy to announce that <a href=\"https://social.msdn.microsoft.com/Forums/en-US/home?forum=ropen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://social.msdn.microsoft.com/Forums/en-US/home?forum%3Dropen&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241466175000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3H1ZfhrQFcDWVR26rYsPTC\">this forum will be hosted on MSDN/TechNet</a>. While you don’t need to sign in to review forum messages,  you’ll need to sign in with a Microsoft account to post a question or reply. Post a message <a href=\"https://social.msdn.microsoft.com/Forums/en-US/home?forum=ropen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://social.msdn.microsoft.com/Forums/en-US/home?forum%3Dropen&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241466175000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3H1ZfhrQFcDWVR26rYsPTC\">there</a> today! </p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>On May 13th, this Google Group forum will be locked/archived.</p>\r\n<p> </p>\r\n<p>Until then, you can post still here or come join us on <a href=\"https://social.msdn.microsoft.com/Forums/en-US/home?forum=ropen\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://social.msdn.microsoft.com/Forums/en-US/home?forum%3Dropen&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1793241466175000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3H1ZfhrQFcDWVR26rYsPTC\">the new forum</a>. See you there!</p>\r\n<p><br></p><p>Thanks,</p><p><br></p><p>#Josée Martens </p></div>"
